CHECK:       error: [GHC-03271]
CHECK-NEXT:  Some units are not loaded but depend on loaded units.
CHECK-NEXT:  q-0.1.0.0 -> p-0.1.0.0

CHECK-LABEL: == P Q R ==
CHECK:       [1 of 3] Compiling P[p-0.1.0.0]
CHECK-NEXT:  [2 of 3] Compiling Q[q-0.1.0.0]
CHECK-NEXT:  [3 of 3] Compiling R[r-0.1.0.0]

